   "Dates checked against the sources listed below, using the Vatican where it states them. Where sources disagree, the note says so.": 1,
   "Born:": 1,
   "May 8, 1828, in Bekaa Kafra, in the Bsharri region of North Lebanon, as Youssef Antoun Makhlouf. See": 1,
   ".": 8,
   "Monastic life:": 1,
   "joined the Lebanese Maronite Order at age 23 and took the name Charbel (Vatican). The": 1,
   "history page": 2,
   "gives 1851.": 1,
